{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37692","headline":"擢第後入蜀经罗村路见海棠盛开偶有题咏 · 郑谷","name":"擢第後入蜀经罗村路见海棠盛开偶有题咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上国休夸红杏𦫢，深溪自照绿苔矶\n一枝低带流莺睡，数片狂和舞蝶飞。\n堪恨路长移不得，可无人与画将归。\n手中已有新春桂，多谢烟香更入衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}